(w) any claim to modify any entry in the Nistar Patrak;
(w-1) any decision regarding penalty under Section 248, for unauthorisedly taking possession of land;
(x) any decision regarding reinstatement of a Bhumiswami improperly dispossessed and confinement in civil prison under Section 250; (x-i) xxx (x-ii) any decision regarding delivery of actual possession of land to the Bhumiswami or the Government Lessee under Section 250-B.

